        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Aha! I wondered why Adam wasn't streaming yesterday, I guess this must be a Necrosis event or something.\n\nThis opening banter is stellar. :)\n\nWhy does the talk about rock climbing feel ominous? :')\n\nSo he's a smusk? Might he be a long one? :V\n\nThe Humorest is low-key a good name though. XD\n\nShort story, but I think we got enough to fulfill the prompt if nothing else!\n\n\"And Sk8blayd has a Writer's Room\" You say that like it's a bad thing! V:<\n\nSo Necrosis is Darth Vader, got it.\n\nomg, the Sk8blayd h8, he's literally just a guy?? D:\n\nAt last! Another hero who is properly XTREEEEEM! :D\n\nYou're telling me he was Dio all a-Zhu Long?\n\nIf Deathcon became Deathfiend, the deaths would cancel out and he'd just be Confiend. :B\n\nSee, the musical stings are why I keep listening to this podcast. :V",
